abstract: >-
  Browser tool and Python code that check a chronic kidney disease dataset, calculate the kidney failure
  risk equation and KDIGO 2024 categories, and decide which patients need a laboratory urine
  albumin-to-creatinine ratio by using the predictive distribution from a routine dipstick.
